		(property "Note" "SYMBOL SUBSTITUTION: KiCad's W25Q32JVSS is the same 8-pin serial-NOR pinout (CS DO WP GND DI CLK HOLD VCC). 1.65-3.6 V, so it spans the whole cell curve. USON-8 2x3 mm, 0.6 mm tall - chosen over SOIC-8 because the board is 26 mm across. Its exposed pad has no symbol pin; bonding it is the LAYOUT's decision, recorded there, not here."
